message: "If you use this project, please cite it and credit the Emergence Machine project."
title: "constitution-dag: a constitutional genealogy of public authority"
abstract: >-
  An open, navigable, source-backed map of a government — from the constitution
  through amendments, statutes, and court decisions into the offices they create
  and empower, across administrative divisions, down to a single place where a
  citizen stands. Part of the Emergence Machine project.
type: dataset
authors:
